ot with ghee.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":10,"text":"Sprinkle 1/4 cup water over rice, close lid tightly and put on heat. when pot starts sizzling lower heat and simmer for 30-40 minutes.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null}},"authoritativeEvidence":{"sourceFileSha256":"93e85705e9141453d5708622c321c17fc793b4fbacfb0663d079fd365e1385d0","parsedRecipesSha256":"b03a74dbe473f11d42d9a7456834d930384c3188d2cf6cae512dfe3cbb50dad5","categoryObservationsSha256":"44b3f050f8fb7ed4bed800554d280e8f9251ea58830e90257f18049ecd70f350"}}
